{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"I reproduced two failures using the existing JVM exporter. The required indentation fixture emits a synthetic DEDENT with empty text that §1.3.6 would reject. A malformed assignment before a newline also produces listener coordinates that disagree with the token’s byte span, so the new error-coordinate check needs an explicit exporter change before generating goldens."}}
